Every clinician should screen an anxiety and should screen a depression during an opioid-taper.
Every clinician should screen an opioid-misuse and should screen an opioid-use-disorder during an opioid-taper.
Every clinician should vigilantly monitor an anxiety-sign and should vigilantly monitor a depression-sign during an opioid-taper.
Every clinician should vigilantly monitor an opioid-misuse-sign and should vigilantly monitor an opioid-use-disorder-sign during an opioid-taper.
Every opioid-taper can possibly reveal an anxiety and can possibly reveal a depression and can possibly reveal an opioid-misuse and can possibly reveal an opioid-use-disorder.
Every clinician should manage a taper-emergent-comorbidity and should provide a treatment.
